%F A065969 From _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 07 2026: (Start)
%F A065969 a(n) = n * A001221(n) + A322078(n).
%F A065969 Dirichlet g.f.: zeta(s-2)*(primezeta(s-2) + primezeta(s)). (End)
%t A065969 a[n_] := n^2 * Total[1 + 1/FactorInteger[n][[;; , 1]]^2]; a[1] = 0; Array[a, 65] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 07 2026 *)
%o A065969 (PARI) a(n) = { my(s=0); foreach(factor(n)[,1], p, s+=1 + 1/p^2); n^2*s } \\ _Harry J. Smith_, Nov 05 2009
